@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

### Get all inventories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventories

### Get one product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventories/1

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Item_Id": 22,
  "Location_Id": 90,
  "Quantity_On_Hand": 5000,
  "Quantity_Expected":1000,
  "Quantity_Ordered": 2000,
  "Quantity_Allocate": 1000
}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/inventories/1